---
import Icon from '../Icon.astro';
import { site, images } from '../../data/site';

// The headline facts (founded, rating, 24/7, vetting) live in the hero's facts bar; this section tells the story behind them.
---
<section class="section st" aria-labelledby="story-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="st__grid">
      <div class="st__aside">
        <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal="fade">Our story</p>
        <h2 id="story-title" class="st__title" data-split>One promise, every ride: <em>door to door.</em></h2>
      </div>

      <div class="st__body">
        <p class="st__statement" data-reveal>
          We started in {site.since} with a simple brief: make the ride the easiest part of the day. It is still the brief for every trip, whether that is a 5&nbsp;a.m. run to SeaTac, a roadshow across the Eastside or a wedding exit in Woodinville wine country.
        </p>
        <div class="st__cols">
          <div class="st__col" data-reveal data-delay="0.05">
            <h3 class="st__h">The people</h3>
            <p>Our chauffeurs are the reason clients come back. They know Seattle inside out, from SR&nbsp;520 at rush hour to the curb at Pier&nbsp;91 on a sailing day.</p>
            <p>Behind them, our concierge team confirms every booking personally and sends your chauffeur’s details before pickup.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="st__col" data-reveal data-delay="0.15">
            <h3 class="st__h">The booking</h3>
            <p>Reserve online in four quick steps, or call and plan it with us. Quotes are transparent: you see the full rate before you confirm, with no hidden fees.</p>
            <p>Need to change a time or add a stop? It is one call or text, any hour of the day.</p>
            <a href="/faq/" class="link-underline st__link">Read the FAQ <Icon name="arrow" /></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="st__gallery">
      <figure class="st__shot st__shot--wide">
        <div class="st__frame" data-reveal="scale">
          <div class="st__par" data-parallax="0.06">
            <img src={images.waterfront} alt="Downtown Seattle and the Elliott Bay waterfront at dusk, with the Great Wheel lit up" width="2600" height="1371" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <figcaption>Downtown and the waterfront, where most evenings begin.</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="st__shot st__shot--side">
        <div class="st__frame" data-reveal="scale" data-delay="0.12">
          <div class="st__par st__par--soft" data-parallax="0.04">
            <img src={images.bellevue} alt="Aerial view of Seattle’s lakes, bridges and skyline at golden hour" width="1080" height="607" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <figcaption>Lakes, bridges and neighborhoods we drive every day.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .st { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-bottom: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem); }
  .st__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.4fr);
    gap: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 7rem);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .st__aside { display: grid; gap: 1.5rem; align-content: start; }
  @media (min-width: 981px) { .st__aside { position: sticky; top: calc(var(--header-h) + 2rem); } }
  .st__title { max-width: 13ch; }
  .st__title :global(.split-line) { vertical-align: top; }
  .st__title em { white-space: nowrap; }

  .st__body { display: grid; gap: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); }
  .st__statement {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 2.3vw, 2.15rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.28;
    letter-spacing: -0.022em;
    color: var(--text);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .st__cols { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 2rem clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem); padding-top: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.4rem); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .st__col { display: grid; gap: 1rem; align-content: start; color: var(--text-2); line-height: 1.7; }
  .st__h { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); }
  .st__link { justify-self: start; min-height: 44px; margin-top: 0.2rem; }
  .st__link::after { bottom: 9px; }
  .st__link :global(svg) { width: 15px; height: 15px; }

  /* ---------- Editorial pair of photographs ---------- */
  .st__gallery {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.65fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    align-items: start;
    margin-top: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 7.5rem);
  }
  .st__shot { display: grid; gap: 0.9rem; }
  .st__shot--side { margin-top: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 7rem); }
  .st__frame { position: relative; overflow: hidden; border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--bg-3); box-shadow: var(--card-shadow); }
  .st__shot--wide .st__frame { aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; }
  /* The Bellevue source is a 1080px landscape: keep it landscape so it is never upscaled into a tall crop */
  .st__shot--side .st__frame { aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; }
  .st__par { position: absolute; inset: -9% 0; }
  .st__par--soft { inset: -5% 0; }
  .st__par img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .st__shot figcaption { font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--muted); padding-left: 1.6rem; position: relative; }
  .st__shot figcaption::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0.72em; width: 1rem; height: 1px; background: var(--accent); }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .st__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .st__title { max-width: 16ch; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .st__cols { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .st__gallery { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .st__shot--side { margin-top: 0; width: 82%; justify-self: end; }
  }
</style>
